4	/**
5	 * Resolve the author for an operation based on auth configuration.
6	 *
7	 * Synchronous — only does in-memory lookups.
8	 * Reads `AGENTACK_USER_TOKEN` from env if no explicit token is provided.
9	 *
10	 * @param options - Auth resolution options
11	 * @param options.token - Explicit token to validate (overrides env var)
12	 * @param options.config - The current config file contents
13	 * @param options.users - The current users file contents
14	 * @param options.requiresWrite - Whether the operation requires write permissions
15	 * @returns `{ author }` on success, or a AgentrackError on auth failure
